 "text": "It took the column nearly eighty hours to cover those fourteen miles. On the evening of December third the lead elements marched down into Hagaru-ri. Behind them came the wounded and the frostbitten and the guns. Witnesses remembered that some of the men were singing the Marines' Hymn as they came in.",
